It's not random. If your nutrition reaches above a certain amount, you
will get the prompt to stop eating if it would make you choke, or
"You're finally finished" if it wouldn't. But, you only get that
message once, at least until you drop below a certain satiation level
(I think it's when you drop back below satiated, but I could be wrong).
If you want to be absolutely safe, never eat anything when you are
already satiated, since it's impossible to choke (on normal food, under
normal conditions) if you start eating when not satiated. It should
also be safe if you just stop eating once you get the message "You are
having a hard time getting it all down" and don't eat again for quite a
while, but as I said, I don't know how long this timeout is.

